  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 (RNA encoder) with avgpool aggregation achieves the highest RNA-only accuracy (0.6501). Testing multimodal models combining scvi_n200 with resnet50 (a strong image encoder) and avgpool (proven effective in RNA-only) isolates the impact of image data integration. This experiment tests whether multimodal fusion improves performance while keeping aggregation consistent with prior successes, balancing exploration of image modality and exploitation of proven RNA encoder strengths."
